WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.100
Run 35 built a resolver nothing read.

2
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.700
Two rounds return two different sets.

3
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.400
The second only when the words change.

4
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.000
The coverage note counts both rounds.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.100
What was substituted is shown.

6
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:22.300
On the partial reports as well.

7
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:26.100
And absent when nothing was substituted.

8
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.800
One function, so the two cannot drift.

9
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.000
The market decides what is searched for.
